      "text": "Créatine phosphokinase (CK)\n\n\n\n• Myosite\n• Rhabdomyolyse\n",
      "text_sha256": "5ac5842cbaa32b06c12d1e81df1fa0c9bc25e841689615fa8a8c919c05aa1b97"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
