        186.9519500732422,
        442.01300048828125,
        207.7781219482422
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "Cortisol\n\n\n\n• Insufsance surrénalienne (dépression)\n• Maladie de Cushing (manie)\n",
      "text_sha256": "5cf8775350cec834528757b10b83879dff63f40f6b20f9938d1d76c32f663bf5"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
