        312.6019592285156,
        447.94482421875,
        333.4281311035156
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "Électrophorèse des protéines\n\n• Néoplasie (myélome multiple, lymphome)\n• Syndrome inammatoire\n",
