    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        340.001953125,
        180.6527862548828,
        359.828125
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0020",
      "order": 20,
      "text": "Recherche d’anticorps auto-immuns –\nfacteur rhumatoïde\n",
      "text_sha256": "1638944e22108328c6126649c6a28c021488616ef297df30d41adf15953343f1"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        293.45001220703125,
        340.001953125,
        395.4830322265625,
        360.828125
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0021",
      "order": 21,
      "text": "\n• Maladies auto-immunes\n• Syndrome inammatoire\n",
      "text_sha256": "ebc1a33c0a52da8534399a29c888933a49b61bf2ca80246e647dccd1ce9e6198"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        367.45196533203125,
        544.6697387695312,
        387.27813720703125
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0022",
      "order": 22,
      "text": "VIH\n\n\n\n\n\n• En présence de facteurs de risque (partagés ou non) pour les infections\ntransmises sexuellement et par le sang (ITSS)\n",
      "text_sha256": "1a93b5e43d373983259cb67b9132019befd805753397872ae16c9c90206a0878"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        393.8519592285156,
        300.5240173339844,
        403.9820251464844
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "Hépatites (VHB, VHC)\n\n",
      "text_sha256": "92893e14e8bf7d5f02dabf290bb02d0e9a9f1de81afd1471da7d391b3c38a2e3"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        410.8019714355469,
        300.5240173339844,
        420.9320373535156
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0024",
      "order": 24,
      "text": "Virus Epstein-Barr (EBV)\n\n",
      "text_sha256": "6dd603940a17b9bdca44661097f3614f8bc24e2d3a701681ec3972f697da2a03"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        427.751953125,
        300.5240173339844,
        437.83203125
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "Cytomégalovirus (CMV)\n\n",
      "text_sha256": "42ac3161b5ad25fdd9705d013a3faf8b60def6f9da9f68b540ce10f3ce4fd186"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        444.70196533203125,
        495.6521301269531,
        454.78204345703125
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0026",
      "order": 26,
      "text": "Maladie de Lyme\n\n\n\n\n• Surtout avec une exposition dans les zones endémiques\n",
      "text_sha256": "83f641386892cc867a9fe651d32bac5a6d970506553c254648203d20be7414eb"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        461.6519470214844,
        182.77395629882812,
        481.4781188964844
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0027",
      "order": 27,
      "text": "Métaux lourds (plomb, mercure, cuivre,\nmanganèse, etc.)\n",
      "text_sha256": "9d5e46d6cfeed3f09716218b590e5429d465c11a7d36007eee001e056f30ad2c"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        213.4499969482422,
        461.6519470214844,
        459.4537048339844,
        471.7320251464844
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0028",
      "order": 28,
      "text": "\n\n• Intoxication chronique liée à l’environnement\n",
      "text_sha256": "c8e7e93d9a3f6cefd14d875d54e5048181e50e592774b8164d170d79b5c22792"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        488.0519714355469,
        375.80499267578125,
        498.1320495605469
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0029",
      "order": 29,
      "text": "Céruloplasmine\n\n\n• Maladie de Wilson\n",
      "text_sha256": "f9a88501eba297b98d52b939d7beae6a7a616174f098740d58e590caf6b36ea2"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        505.001953125,
        393.87200927734375,
        515.08203125
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0030",
      "order": 30,
      "text": "Porphyrines\n\n\n\n\n\n• Porphyrie (maladie rare)\n",
      "text_sha256": "09a617d2bad0eca91d08043e4f98c6d5fbd54126b5a4b558f806c7982f28e19c"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        57.25,
        521.8728637695312,
        165.8791046142578,
        531.8923950195312
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0031",
      "order": 31,
      "text": "Tests diagnostiques techniques\n",
      "text_sha256": "e9a70317f88fef5639f91e785e6b18aeacb51ed7d237e388c8dcedf3d98836ac"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        538.3519897460938,
        366.4637756347656,
        559.1781616210938
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0032",
      "order": 32,
      "text": "Électrocardiogramme (ECG)\n\n\n\n\n\n• Infarctus\n• Mesure du QTc\n",
      "text_sha256": "f4468f570d6db5b09efb63119df087ddeda9b55bfece0267cf22522f94d07194"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        565.8019409179688,
        550.7576293945312,
        575.8820190429688
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0033",
      "order": 33,
      "text": "Radiographie pulmonaire\n\n\n\n\n\n• Recherche d’un cancer, particulièrement chez les fumeurs et les plus de 40 ans\n",
      "text_sha256": "12584e218194937beaee869ee04983cc8c29f2e8e695a26e469b793f850735b5"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        582.7019653320312,
        517.8935546875,
        602.5281372070312
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0034",
      "order": 34,
      "text": "Imagerie cérébrale\n\n\n\n• Symptômes neuropsychiatriques, particulièrement en présence\nde facteurs de risque cardiovasculaires\n",
      "text_sha256": "e9a397a7fb7796a6862bef3caf65a39e2cc670f09c090b7c1951ec02cd76a92e"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        610.1519775390625,
        547.8872680664062,
        640.9781494140625
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0035",
      "order": 35,
      "text": "Électroencéphalogramme (EEG)\n\n\n\n• Anomalies épileptiformes\n• Objectiver un delirium (ralentissement du rythme, surtout en postérieur) ;\ntype hypoactif mimant parfois une dépression\n",
      "text_sha256": "7129a2d4ac510daa45088862379187c0426d0a0a268d7c8ca7aee2d64d19f5f1"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        58.25,
        649.6019897460938,
        358.9070129394531,
        670.4281616210938
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0036",
      "order": 36,
      "text": "Ponction lombaire\n\n\n\n• Infection\n• Inammation\n",
      "text_sha256": "1c2a68f89d26ee6d1fce26b8decf26616b149254588667d1b68ef4226e693815"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        54.25,
        678.5625,
        188.3386993408203,
        698.375
      ],
      "block_id": "page-0650-block-0037",
      "order": 37,
      "text": ": Test recommandé\n: Test à considérer selon la suspicion clinique\n",
      "text_sha256": "0c02eaf97d62f66f4cfb9e3bdc7d15e2386d17763f7de917b1e77a32c5b5f080"
    },
